ChatGAi is an application that uses the most advanced artificial intelligence technology. It can imitate the way humans chat, providing you with a real and natural dialogue experience. It also has super self-learning ability and can truly create content independently. It can be used in In your life, play any role you need:

When you are depressed, it can be your best friend and guide you to relieve negative emotions;
When you can't solve math problems, it can be a teacher, teaching you how to think and solve problems;
When you are worried about your thesis, it can be your tutor and guide you in the direction of the thesis;
When your program goes wrong, it can also be an experienced technician to help you find the bug;
It is proficient in various languages, you can communicate with it in any language;
It is familiar with all kinds of poems and songs, and you can create more beautiful poems with his help;
It understands everything in nature, and you can get any knowledge you want to know more quickly;
…

ChatGAi has more rich and interesting application scenarios, and there is no doubt that it can make you think and create more efficiently, but you need to have your own judgment, because what it says is not necessarily correct~

If you like ChatGAI or have any other comments, please take a moment to write your comments, or email chatgaiteams@outlook.com. This will help us continuously improve our products and provide you with a better experience!


About Subscription:
1. Subscription service: continuous monthly subscription for members, continuous annual subscription for members.
2. Subscription price: The continuous monthly subscription for members is $1.99/month, and the 60% discount for continuous annual subscription is $9.99/year.
3. Payment: The payment will be deducted from the user's iTunes account, and the payment will be made after the user confirms the purchase.
4. Renewal: The Apple iTunes account will deduct the fee within 24 hours before the expiration. After the deduction is successful, the subscription period will be extended by 1 subscription period.
5. Cancel subscription: If you need to cancel the subscription, please operate at least 24 hours before the end of the current subscription period. The operation method: enter the system [Settings] —> click [iTunes Store and App Store] —> click [Apple ID] —> click [Subscription], select ChatGAi to unsubscribe.


